    createStaticVNode('<h1 id="运行-bench-与单环境任务" tabindex="-1">运行 Bench 与单环境任务 <a class="header-anchor" href="#运行-bench-与单环境任务" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;运行 Bench 与单环境任务&quot;">​</a></h1><p>CLI 有两个明确入口：<code>run</code> 调度评测套件，<code>env</code> 接收人工输入的导航指令。两者最后都把一个完整 Task 交给同一个 <code>NavigationHarness</code>，任务内部都由 Agent 主导。</p><h2 id="批量评测" tabindex="-1">批量评测 <a class="header-anchor" href="#批量评测" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;批量评测&quot;">​</a></h2><div class="language-bash vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">bash</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">export</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> PYTHONPATH</span><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">=</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">$PWD</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">/src&quot;</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;">python</span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> -m</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> harness.cli</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> run</span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> \\</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  --runner</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> config/runners/r2r_streamvln.yaml</span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> \\</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  --agent</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> config/agents/passthrough_streamvln.yaml</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br><span class="line-number">2</span><br><span class="line-number">3</span><br><span class="line-number">4</span><br></div></div><p>Runner 配置引用一个或多个 Bench；每个 Bench 再引用自己的 Env。Agent 配置引用自己的 VLN 与 Memory，因此启动参数不会出现互相矛盾的 Bench/Env 或 Agent/VLN 组合。</p><p>退出码规则：所有 Task failure、case error、Bench error 和 cleanup error 都为零时返回 0，任一类非零返回 1。Runner/Agent 配置无法加载、Manifest 无法写入等全局错误直接抛出；单个 Bench 的构造、case 流或 session-scoped 清理失败写入该 Bench 结果，其他 Bench 仍会完成并共同产出 Manifest。</p><h3 id="dummy-回归" tabindex="-1">Dummy 回归 <a class="header-anchor" href="#dummy-回归" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Dummy 回归&quot;">​</a></h3><div class="language-bash vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">bash</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;">bash</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> scripts/run_dummy.sh</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br></div></div><h3 id="三个-r2r-模型入口" tabindex="-1">三个 R2R 模型入口 <a class="header-anchor" href="#三个-r2r-模型入口" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;三个 R2R 模型入口&quot;">​</a></h3><div class="language-bash vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">bash</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;">bash</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> scripts/run_r2r_streamvln.sh</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;">bash</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> scripts/run_r2r_janusvln.sh</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;">bash</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> scripts/run_r2r_dualvln.sh</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br><span class="line-number">2</span><br><span class="line-number">3</span><br></div></div><p>脚本只调用 PATH 中的 <code>python -m harness.cli</code>，不选择 Python 或激活环境。</p><h2 id="单环境交互" tabindex="-1">单环境交互 <a class="header-anchor" href="#单环境交互" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;单环境交互&quot;">​</a></h2><div class="language-bash vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">bash</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;">bash</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> scripts/run_dummy_interactive.sh</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br></div></div><p>等价命令为：</p><div class="language-bash vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">bash</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">PYTHONPATH</span><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">=</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">src</span><span style="--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;"> python</span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> -m</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> harness.cli</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> env</span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> \\</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  --environment</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> config/envs/dummy.yaml</span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;"> \\</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">  --agent</span><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;"> config/agents/passthrough.yaml</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br><span class="line-number">2</span><br><span class="line-number">3</span><br></div></div><p>每行输入构造一个 <code>NavTask</code> 和 <code>EnvironmentEpisode</code>，然后调用一次 <code>Agent.run(context)</code>。CLI 只 提交指令、等待 Task 结束和显示结果，不代替 Agent 获取观测或执行动作。输入 <code>quit</code> / <code>exit</code> 退出 CLI；Agent 调用 <code>nav.stop</code> 只结束当前 Task。</p><p>基础版本每条指令创建新的 task-scoped Environment。若以后需要同一真机连接或仿真 session 跨 指令保持，应在 Environment 连接池/会话层扩展，不改变 Agent 工具协议。</p><p><code>InteractiveNavigationSession</code> 是串行会话：并发调用 <code>navigate()</code> 时，后续指令等待前一完整 Task 及其清理结束；<code>close()</code> 也通过同一会话锁等待当前导航完成，再关闭 session-scoped VLN。关闭出现普通 错误时可以再次调用重试。该约束防止一个共享 VLN worker 同时绑定两个 Env。</p><h2 id="python-api" tabindex="-1">Python API <a class="header-anchor" href="#python-api" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Python API&quot;">​</a></h2><div class="language-python vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">python</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">import</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> asyncio</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">from</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> harness.app </span><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">import</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> execute_runner</span></span>\n<span class="line"></span>\n<span class="line"></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">async</span><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;"> def</span><span style="--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;"> main</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">() -&gt; </span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">None</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">:</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">    run_summary, manifest </span><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">=</span><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;"> await</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> execute_runner(</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">        &quot;config/runners/dummy_passthrough.yaml&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">,</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;">        &quot;config/agents/passthrough.yaml&quot;</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">,</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">    )</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">    for</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> benchmark </span><span style="--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;">in</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;"> run_summary.benchmarks:</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">        print</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">(benchmark.benchmark, </span><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">len</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">(benchmark.records))</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;">    print</span><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">(manifest)</span></span>\n<span class="line"></span>\n<span class="line"></span>\n<span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;">asyncio.run(main())</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br><span class="line-number">2</span><br><span class="line-number">3</span><br><span class="line-number">4</span><br><span class="line-number">5</span><br><span class="line-number">6</span><br><span class="line-number">7</span><br><span class="line-number">8</span><br><span class="line-number">9</span><br><span class="line-number">10</span><br><span class="line-number">11</span><br><span class="line-number">12</span><br><span class="line-number">13</span><br><span class="line-number">14</span><br><span class="line-number">15</span><br></div></div><p>同步调用方使用 <code>execute_runner_sync(runner_path, agent_path)</code>；不要在已有 event loop 中嵌套调用。</p><h2 id="并行语义" tabindex="-1">并行语义 <a class="header-anchor" href="#并行语义" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;并行语义&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><code>bench_parallelism</code>：同时运行多少个完整 Bench；</li><li><code>task_parallelism</code>：一个 Bench 内同时运行多少个完整 Task；</li><li><code>max_cases</code>：每个 Bench 的 case 流截断；</li><li>case 的 stack/execution/score 异常写入 <code>CaseRecord.error_stage/error</code>，其他 case 继续；</li><li>score 异常保留已经完成的 <code>NavigationResult</code>，不会丢失 terminal、环境结果和 audit；</li><li>Bench 构造或 case 流异常写入 <code>BenchmarkSummary.error</code>，其他 Bench 继续；</li><li>Bench 成功后的共享资源清理异常写入 <code>BenchmarkSummary.cleanup_errors</code>；</li><li>每个 Bench 的结果按输入序号排序，而不是按完成先后；</li><li>每个 Bench 完成后关闭它的 session-scoped VLN。</li></ul><p>同一个 Task 内的 Agent、VLN worker 与 Environment 可以异步协作，但不由 Runner 分别调度。 <code>serial: true</code> 或持久化 Memory 出现在任一 stack 时，多 Bench 并行会在运行前失败；VLN 只有 <code>scope: session</code> 时则允许不同 Bench 各自创建 worker 并行。</p><h2 id="普通任务与连续任务" tabindex="-1">普通任务与连续任务 <a class="header-anchor" href="#普通任务与连续任务" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;普通任务与连续任务&quot;">​</a></h2><p>R2R/ObjectNav 的 case 通常只有一个 Goal。GOAT case 是单个多 Goal Task：</p><div class="language-text vp-adaptive-theme line-numbers-mode"><button title="Copy Code" class="copy"></button><span class="lang">text</span><pre class="shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code" tabindex="0"><code><span class="line"><span>Bench emits one GOAT Case containing one compound Task</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>BenchmarkExecutor schedules that Case once</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>Agent -&gt; Goal 0 -&gt; goal.finish -&gt; Goal 1 -&gt; ... -&gt; final Goal -&gt; nav.stop</span></span>\n<span class="line"><span>Environment remains alive for the whole Task</span></span></code></pre><div class="line-numbers-wrapper" aria-hidden="true"><span class="line-number">1</span><br><span class="line-number">2</span><br><span class="line-number">3</span><br><span class="line-number">4</span><br></div></div><p>并行只发生在不同复合 Task 之间。Bench loader 保持 Goal 序列属于同一 Case，Executor 原样保留 该边界，因此不会破坏 GOAT 的连续位置与 Task 内记忆。</p>', 28)
